= He Xiangning

A revolutionary feminist since the 1911 revolution, she was also the wife of Liao Zhongkai before his tragic assassination in 1925. She is an active advocate for women's rights and cultural reform, and, if well utilized, can play a major role in organizing the Chinese masses.

